  "stem": "<!--版权声明：试题（含题干、答案、解析）由学科网授权提供，受版权保护--><div class=\"qml-stem\" data-copyright=\"xkw.com-1791861838-114651791852237200-G4kp-u3VP21coQMQfxf4VV3mQaaskpJnYM-9XZSE4M49QFvXuIaahQlbWKvH12cv\"><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">如图（</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">a</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）所示，质量为</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/bd807b00edd29e8e04815363be86f24c.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的长方体箱子在水平拉力</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/a0ed1ec316bc54c37c4286c208f55667.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">作用下沿水平面向右加速运动，箱子与水平面间的动摩擦因数</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/c8486580b44c5c4b2fd9bfec88ef3510.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。箱内后壁上有两物块</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/ff4489d9b83072184c0e1d6b09be50ca.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/ea1e8babee63bfc889ae5a34632284bc.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，其质量均为</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/94776b37df8aebae4d70e3ea49030348.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，与后壁间的动摩擦因数分别为</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/3639b9b596019a23574b1dc4bf3e0ade.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">和</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/60a80b95b69b2ccccd0954bf5f2ddfdc.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/a0ed1ec316bc54c37c4286c208f55667.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">随时间</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/36a1b09c653185842513e24ebba60bb3.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的变化关系如图（</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">b</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">）所示，当</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/412cc95279a267f6b1a8588555b6eba1.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时，</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/ff4489d9b83072184c0e1d6b09be50ca.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">恰好静止在后壁上，</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/ea1e8babee63bfc889ae5a34632284bc.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">静止在后壁上；当</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/26399af5e5352c829a3788d2695a0dda.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">时，</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/ea1e8babee63bfc889ae5a34632284bc.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">恰好静止在后壁上。在运动过程中，</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/ff4489d9b83072184c0e1d6b09be50ca.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">、</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/ea1e8babee63bfc889ae5a34632284bc.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">始终没有相碰。设最大静摩擦力等于滑动摩擦力，忽略空气阻力，且</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/276509f01529d982ab21e479a4619268.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">取</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/736b8522a2085470659d492f648092eb.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。求：</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><img  height=\"156\" source-file=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/QBM/editorImg/2026/9/30/4ef43afd-2b35-4a16-8825-7b6020380400.psd\" src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/QBM/editorImg/2026/9/30/4ef43afd-2b35-4a16-8825-7b6020380400.png\" width=\"334\" /></p><div class=\"qml-sq\" id-container=\"question\"><div class=\"qml-stem\" data-copyright=\"xkw.com-1791861838-114651791852237200-G4kp-u3VP21coQMQfxf4VV3mQaaskpJnYM-9XZSE4M49QFvXuIaahQlbWKvH12cv\"><p style=\"\"><span class=\"ques-no\">（1）</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/f5076289823db419f94e9c0c8f4aafd9.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的大小；</span></p></div></div><div class=\"qml-sq\" id-container=\"question\"><div class=\"qml-stem\" data-copyright=\"xkw.com-1791861838-114651791852237200-G4kp-u3VP21coQMQfxf4VV3mQaaskpJnYM-9XZSE4M49QFvXuIaahQlbWKvH12cv\"><p style=\"\"><span class=\"ques-no\">（2）</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/a3fb78c5f885034612c0e030b920143d.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的大小及在</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/4ba9b122ac217651468b4dac1ed78376.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">的时间内摩擦力对物块</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/ff4489d9b83072184c0e1d6b09be50ca.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">所做的功，已知</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/e21d53a6bafcce04554c63d92ced36af.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">。</span></p></div></div></div>",
