yle=\"font-family: 宋体;\">有</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/2342deb42bb2d2ef77bf1c8d8d9eb4c2.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">，</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/2ce396b8a6e2f8e868c80552799a42e0.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">得</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/1bbfbea7d1ee4881083b8432f42ae49e.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">对</span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">A</span><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">有</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/0b512144aceee9c387471d13b27f08b3.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">得</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/34b3cf4328b7845b8cb0cee311834d81.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">对箱子有</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/8a2d213900d767940b4c3c6dcf1c2a05.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">其中</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/bcc1c8700abac46c36b53ae27054f83b.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">得</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/02670ceff6fd5f8085c6f810dd10068d.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">对整体有</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/dksih/formula/9625ef6c44d67e1bc9ca51f2ccc6d2ac.svg\" class=\"xkw-math-img\" /></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;word-break:break-word;\"><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">得</span><img  src=\"https://img.xkw.com/